'''Rabbit Satoru''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

